WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:06.700
Claimant: Hi, I came home and found dark soot marks on my sofa and curtains. I don’t know when or how the soot got there.

00:00:06.700 --> 00:00:35.900
Adjuster: Decision: requires further review. The claimant reports soot on the sofa and curtains, but CA-HO4-SMOKE requires sudden accidental smoke damage and excludes smoke from agricultural smudging or industrial operations. The cause and whether the damage was sudden and accidental remain unknown. Next action: Obtain available incident details or inspection findings to determine the smoke source and whether the damage was sudden and accidental.
